ly with her left, warm inviting smile, eyes locked on the camera lens. The composition is a medium close-up shot filling the frame with the UI overlay. The screen layout strictly follows the authentic Douyin live stream design: a red header bar at the top displaying \"直播中\" (Live) and a digital fan count \"12.5 万\" (125,000 fans) in white text with a red heart icon next to it; the right side features a vertical stack of floating interaction elements including a large glowing red \"点赞\" (Like) button with a counter \"98.2k\", a \"礼物\" (Gift) icon with a small animated rocket effect \"🚀\" in gold color, and a comment section (弹幕) at the bottom third of the screen displaying scrolling white text bubbles against a semi-transparent black background with specific phrases like \"主播太美了\" (The anchor is too beautiful) and \"已下单\" (Ordered) in a clean sans-serif font. The background behind the streamer is a softly blurred, stylish home studio setting with warm ambient lighting, soft box lights visible, creating a bokeh effect that emphasizes the subject. The image style is photorealistic, 8k resolution, shot on 35mm lens with f/1.8 aperture for shallow depth of field, high dynamic range, sharp focus on the anchor's face and the product, vibrant colors, realistic skin texture with visible pores, and motion blur on the scrolling comments to simulate live activity."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 294, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 211, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [282, 283, 299], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [140, 46], "pos": [-2616.483154296875, 4292.076171875], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 295, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 296, "label":